flowchart TB
accTitle: Readiness must precede DNS cutover
accDescr: Primary failure starts recovery orchestration, which fences old writes, prepares the database and compute, then gates DNS cutover on a successful write test.
H["Application health failure"]:::inputData --> N["CloudWatch alarm → SNS"]
N --> F["Recovery workflow
fence primary writes"]
F --> D["Promote PostgreSQL replica"]:::storage
F --> C["Scale secondary EC2 group"]
D --> V{"Database and app
pass write test?"}:::decision
C --> V
V -->|Yes| R["Update DNS
serve recovered application"]:::output
V -->|No| X["Retry or escalate
keep cutover blocked"]:::warning
T["30-minute RTO includes
detection through client recovery"]:::inputData -.-> R
